📋 Program 4 — Copy One Text File into Another

📌 Description

This program demonstrates how to copy the contents of one text file into another file.

It uses an input stream to read the source file line by line and an output stream to write those lines into a destination file.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- 📖 Reading from a text file
- ✍️ Writing to another text file
- 🔄 File-to-file data transfer
- ⚠️ Source and destination file validation
- 🔒 Closing file streams

📁 Files Used

- "message.txt"
- "message_copy.txt"

🧠 Main C++ Features

"std::ifstream" and "std::ofstream"
